# NEXUS UI component names

Every reusable Vue component under `packages/ui/src/components/` uses the NEXUS `N` prefix.

- Filename: `NFileUpload.vue`
- JavaScript import/export: `NFileUpload`
- Vue template: `<n-file-upload>`

Apply the prefix to public widgets and internal reusable components (`NFileRow`, `NListItemForm`). Export public components from `packages/ui/src/index.js` under their `N…` name, then update every consuming import and template. Do not keep unprefixed compatibility aliases unless the user explicitly requests a deprecation period.

Composables and helpers are not components: keep names such as `useOwnerFiles`, `createNexusI18n`, and `setAppLocale`.

When adding or renaming a component, update `packages/ui/README.md`, `PACKAGES.md`, and any other documentation or examples that name it.
